<Guide
  title="How do you show up properly on Google and Maps? | PISMA"
  description="Your Google profile (Business Profile) is your first impression in Search and Maps. Step by step: verification, category, hours, photos, reviews."
  slug="google-maps-profile"
  lang="en"
  question="How do you show up properly on Google and Maps?"
  sub="For every business that wants to be found easily — no technical knowledge needed."
  answer="You create (or claim) your Google Business Profile for free, verify it and fill it in: the right category, real hours, fresh photos, services and a description. Then you make sure your name, address and phone number are the same everywhere — on your site, in directories, on social — and you reply to reviews. That way both Google and AI tools like ChatGPT find you correctly."
  updated="2026-07-28"
